    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n85448" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολύ-τρητος</span></b> , poet. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολυ-πουλύ-</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>much-pierced, full of
				holes, porous,</i>
			
