				22.439
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φῷδες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Cratin.
					213
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φύλλα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					2.182
				</span></i>
