				Aret.
				<u>SD</u>
				1.10
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ π. τῆς χώρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					12.8.16
				</span></i>
